---
import SubpageLayout from '../layouts/SubpageLayout.astro';
import Checklist from '../components/Checklist.astro';
import PhotoCredit from '../components/PhotoCredit.astro';
---
<SubpageLayout
  title="Best Rawal Lake Views from Lake View Park"
  description="Best Rawal Lake viewpoints from Lake View Park Islamabad: where to look, best times for light, and what to expect without claiming private access."
  path="/rawal-lake-views/"
  faq={[
    { q: 'Where are the best Rawal Lake views in the park?', a: 'The open lakeside front along Rawal Lake is the signature setting; the main lakefront paths and open lawns face the water and are the easiest places to pause for a view. This guide does not claim any private or guaranteed-open viewpoint.' },
    { q: 'What is the best time for photos?', a: 'Early morning and the hour around sunset generally give the softest light and calmer water. Weekdays are usually quieter than weekends. These are planning suggestions, not a guarantee of access.' },
    { q: 'Can I reach the water’s edge?', a: 'Stick to marked paths and open areas; do not cross barriers or enter the water. Respect any cordoned or staff-only sections.' },
    { q: 'Is the view affected by the season?', a: 'Winter brings clearer, cooler days and migratory birds; summer heat and monsoon rain can limit comfortable time outdoors. Plan around the weather.' },
  ]}
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Home', href: '/' }, { name: 'Rawal Lake views', href: '/rawal-lake-views/' }]}
  image="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg"
  related={[
    { label: 'Boating', href: '/boating/' },
    { label: 'Rawal Lake guide', href: '/rawal-lake-guide/' },
    { label: 'Sunset visit', href: '/sunset-visit/' },
    { label: 'Things to do', href: '/things-to-do/' },
  ]}
>
  <article class="space-y-8">
    <p class="text-lg leading-8 text-slate-700">The open lakeside front along Rawal Lake is the park’s signature setting. These notes help you find good viewpoints and light without implying any area is privately accessible or guaranteed open.</p>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Where to look</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">The main lakefront paths and open lawns face the water and are the easiest places to pause for a view. Walking further along the shore changes the angle and the crowds, often for the better.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Best times for light</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Soft morning light and the golden hour before sunset are the most flattering for the lake and the hills beyond. Evenings are lovely but busier, especially at weekends.</p>
    </section>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">What you might see</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Depending on season, Rawal Lake draws migratory birds in winter and offers wide water-and-sky views year round. Sightings are never guaranteed — the lake’s mood is the point.</p>
    </section>

    <div class="rounded-2xl bg-[#f3ede0] p-5">
      <p class="text-sm font-black text-[#5b4a2f]">No claimed-exact viewpoints map</p>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-7 text-[#5b4a2f]">This guide does not mark precise photo spots with verified coordinates. Use the open, publicly accessible lakefront and follow on-site paths and any restricted areas.</p>
    </div>

    <section>
      <h2 class="text-2xl font-black text-[#143844]">Light, crowds and seasons</h2>
      <p class="mt-3 leading-8">Early morning and the hour around sunset generally give the softest light and calmest water; weekdays are quieter than weekends. Winter brings clearer, cooler days and migratory birds, while summer heat and monsoon rain can limit comfortable time outdoors — plan the viewpoint around the weather, not the other way round.</p>
    </section>

    <Checklist items={[
      'Use the lakefront paths and open lawns for easy viewpoints.',
      'Aim for early morning or near sunset for the best light.',
      'Keep to marked paths and do not enter the water.',
      'Bring a phone with decent low-light performance for sunset.',
      'Pair the view with a lake walk or picnic rather than a single stop.',
    ]} />

    <figure>
      <img src="/images/rawal-lake-islamabad.jpg" width="1280" height="960" alt="Calm Rawal Lake view from Lake View Park, Islamabad" class="h-[360px] w-full rounded-[2rem] object-cover card-shadow" loading="lazy" />
      <figcaption><PhotoCredit photo={2} /></figcaption>
    </figure>
  </article>
</SubpageLayout>
